# composite5.py rewrites every variant into the whole 1200x2670 drawer screenshot and crops a
# two-row strip out of it, which is several MB of PNG that regenerates in one command. Kept: the
# contact sheet, and the six per-variant layers that are small and that somebody may want to look
# at without running anything. Everything the gallery needs is inside gallery.html as data URIs,
# including the drawer strips.
*-drawer.png
*-crop.png
